{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Go to meet Moses in the wilderness.</b> As a disciple going to receive the master, as it says: וְאַתָּה תִּהְיֶה לּוֹ לֵאלֹהִים — and you shall be to him for Elohim." "<b>And he met him on the mountain of HaElohim.</b> On his return from Midian to go to Egypt." "<b>And he kissed him.</b> As one kisses a holy thing, as in the verse: וַיִּשָּׁקֵהוּ וַיֹּאמֶר הֲלוֹא כִּי מְשָׁחֲךָ ה' עַל נַחֲלָתוֹ לְנָגִיד — and he kissed him and said, Is it not that YHWH has anointed you over His heritage as prince? (1 Samuel 10:1)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:28.339194052Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}